00:10:31.059 --> 00:10:33.051
The voice of an angelic voice.

00:10:33.051 --> 00:10:34.240
- It was a surreal moment.

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:36.352
I feel like he was Jay-Z, I was Alicia.

00:10:36.352 --> 00:10:37.402
- I thought that too.

00:10:37.432 --> 00:10:39.141
- We were just going in.

00:10:39.141 --> 00:10:40.440
- The thing with Times Square

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:42.600
is I feel it's only as good
as the company you keep.

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:43.621
- Yes.

00:10:43.621 --> 00:10:47.621
("Adolescence" by Mel Croucher)

